    "title": "Oakland City under boil advisory - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andrew Newland ,\n1 hours ago\nOAKLAND CITY, Ind. (WEHT) — A boil advisory has been issued for the entirety of Oakland City.\nOakland City Mayor James Deffendall says all Oakland City Water customers will need to boil their water until further notice.\nOfficials have not said what prompted the boil advisory.\nEyewitness News is working to get more information.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Eyewitness News (WEHT/WTVW).",
